Install program :
1. You only edit the file 'pri_config.php' and upload all files to your target.
2. under sql directory, import the file calendar to your MySQL database.
3. admin page like : http://yourdomain/admin/
4. admin default login id and password, please see the file pri_config.php
5. you can edit any .html file as you need.


about langage :
2200net Calendar support multi language.
When you save the file, remember save as UNICODE type and keep the same file name.


News 2006/03/20
2200net Calendar v.2.0
1. database 'webcfg' add new fields :
     datetype  varchar(30) NOT NULL default 'yymmdd'
     firstweek char(3)     NOT NULL default 'sun'
     theme     varchar(40) NOT NULL default 'default'
2. The week start Monday or Sunday, you can choice.
3. Calendar start and end make a limited config.
4. Fix some secureity bug.
5. On website common config page, you can change admin login name.
6. Theme select.
7. How to upgrade the program from 1.x to 2.0 ...
   Remove all files and copy this new version(2.0) program to the original path.
   Datebase add new fields, see the file 'upgrade1.x_2.0' in the sql path.
   You cam use like 'PhpAdmin' to import the file.


